 "sourceFacts": {
  "zeroLists": "All 67 WB files carry one zeroing block (Class_35259f6b/Field_58d70acb/Field_7d5dc312). Lists: [60] on 22 (11 SMG, 7 sidearm, 4 shotgun, incl. RSPR), [75] on 9 carbines, [100] on 23 (12 assault rifles and 11 LMGs, incl. Mk 24 and Z84M), [100,200,300,400,500] on 13 (7 snipers incl. ELR-40, 6 DMRs). 51 launch singletons plus 3 Season 5 singletons = 54; 12 launch brackets plus ELR-40 = 13. Identical to the 1.4.3.0 lists on all 63 launch weapons.",
  "blockFields": "Booleans at +440/+441/+442, i32 +444/+448, list pointer +456, f32 +472; the 54 singleton blocks have null registry anchors and store min/max/delay -1/-1/0.01; the 13 brackets import GRX Shot.Zeroing rows with 100/1000/0.4.",
  "siteToday": {
   "today": "sim/ballistics.js:93-94 zeroRelativeVerticalOffset(model, distance, zero=null): a null zero returns trajectoryAtDistance(model, distance) at launch angle 0 (bore-relative). ui/app.js:342-347 isZeroableWeapon is cls DMR or Sniper Rifle only; zeroDistanceFor returns state.recoil.zeroDistance (default 100, ui/app.js:189; cycle 100-500, ui/app.js:2626-2629) for those 13 weapons and null (bore-relative) for the other 54. No fixed non-null zero exists for non-DMR weapons. Sight height is omitted (sim/ballistics.js:91)."
  },
  "trajectories": "M4A1 (590 m/s, drag 0.0035, g -9.81 from data/weapons.json and data/ballistics.json) with the site solver: bore-relative -3.97/-18.05/-46.45 cm at 50/100/150 m; 75 m zero +2.37/-5.36/-27.42 cm. Arithmetic: flight time to 100 m = expm1(0.0035x100)/(0.0035x590) = 0.2029 s; half g t^2 = 0.2020 m; the RK4 vector solution with vertical drag gives 0.1805 m. 75 m zero launch angle 1.2689 mrad gives -0.0536 m at 100 m.",
