 ],
 "unresolved": [
  "Units of Field_410f6aa8 (metres assumed); no cited screenshot or text in the repo shows the in-game zeroing menu labels, so the assumption rests on the site's own 100-500 m options and the source 100/1000 min/max scale, not on a menu match.",
  "Role of the list: which entry is the default selection, and whether a singleton is an aim-point zero at all, is not in the serialized data (FIELD_MAP: list role and active selection unresolved).",
  "Names of the six block fields come from registry value matching and the 19 Oct hash pairing; the 54 unanchored blocks store min/max/delay -1/-1/0.01, not 100/1000/0.4 (raw checked).",
  "Runtime consumer of CustomZeroing/RangeFinder; whether the ELR-40 zero works without the FN Elity sight is the operator's observation, not a source fact.",
  "Sight height, game zero convention and the engine ballistic model are not source-established; the site model omits sight height.",
