 ],
 "siteImpact": "Conditional. If the firing-range glance (M4A1 iron sight, 100 m plate centre) reads near -5 cm: add a per-weapon source zero (data/weapons.json, new field zeroDistanceM = first list entry) and use it in ui/app.js zeroDistanceFor for all 67 weapons; the 54 singleton weapons move at 100 m by +8.8 to +34.7 cm (mean +16.6 cm; M4A1 -18.05 to -5.36 cm); the 13 DMR/sniper default stays 100 m (first entry equals the current default). If near -18 cm: no change, record that the singleton is not an aim zero. Any other reading: no change, zero model unresolved. No site number changes now.",
 "outOfScopeNotes": [
