  "frosty-site-zeroing-audit.py writes beside its input under builds\\1.4.3.0 and cannot be rerun to a new folder; frosty-zeroing-review.py is hardcoded to builds/1.4.3.0 and its XML overlay (no 2.1.1.0 XML exists), so neither was reusable as written; zero_scan.py here is an adapted copy."
